; ArcLibre: Hdr:SprExtend for the printing modules. The JPEG SWIs of
; SpriteExtend, numbered from SpriteExtendJPEGSWI_Base in Hdr:SWIs in the
; order of SpriteExtend's own SWI table (src/SprExtend/Sources/SWIs).

        SUBT    Exported SpriteExtend JPEG SWIs => Hdr.SprExtend

OldOpt  SETA    {OPT}
        OPT     OptNoList+OptNoP1List

SWIClass        SETS    SpriteExtendJPEGSWI_Name

        ^       SpriteExtendJPEGSWI_Base

        AddSWI  Info                            ; &49980
        AddSWI  FileInfo                        ; &49981
        AddSWI  PlotScaled                      ; &49982
        AddSWI  PlotFileScaled                  ; &49983
        AddSWI  PlotTransformed                 ; &49984
        AddSWI  PlotFileTransformed             ; &49985
        AddSWI  PDriverIntercept                ; &49986

        OPT     OldOpt
        END
